B.a0B=new A.dp("opinion_reason","Give an opinion with reasons","Ideas and Opinions","I can state an opinion, support it and acknowledge another view.",B.kE,B.p4,"\u4fbf\u5229\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u8cbb\u7528\u304c\u5c11\u3057\u9ad8\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002","Benri da to omoimasu ga, hiyou ga sukoshi takai desu.",u.P,B.Zd,0,"Softening a disagreement can keep attention on the issue rather than the person.","Reading lamp","\ud83d\udca1","work_explain")
